{"id":"29860e308d5c5265","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence.md","title":"统一组合蕴含统一去引号而反向仅逐个实例","display":"lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence — 统一组合蕴含统一去引号而反向仅逐个实例","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence","aliases":["91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence","91-lem-comp-equiv","91-lem-axiom-equivalence"],"display":"lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence — 统一组合蕴含统一去引号而反向仅逐个实例","depends_on":["[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]","[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-conjunction-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence</span><span>91-lem-comp-equiv</span><span>91-lem-axiom-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence — 统一组合蕴含统一去引号而反向仅逐个实例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73ccb673e6681e3d\" href=\"?note=73ccb673e6681e3d\" title=\"91-thm-compositional-completeness\">91-thm-compositional-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8841d990db08f7a2\" href=\"?note=8841d990db08f7a2\" title=\"91-df-conjunction-axiom\">91-df-conjunction-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\)</span> 取已校准版本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> 是原书全归纳版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\subseteq\\mathrm{CT}^{-}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\subseteq\\mathrm{CT}^{-}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一行使用上节点的标准矩阵结构归纳。第二行把三个闭句的 TB 双条件合成；否定、析取的固定闭句实例同理。\n第二行不能合并为对所有模型句子编码的统一组合公理；TB 的有限标准实例没有自动给出非标准编码上的递归满足条件。故不是两个完整公理化的等价。特别是全归纳 CT 非保守而全归纳 TB、UTB 保守，足以否定无条件反向等价。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 8.4、Theorem 7.5、Corollary 8.33；固定实例合成为经典逻辑推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-compositional-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conjunction-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"8841d990db08f7a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conjunction-axiom]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\subseteq\\mathrm{CT}^{-}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})).","display":true}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["73ccb673e6681e3d","6018cc1b13710826","8841d990db08f7a2"]}